st","id":"157295","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53621","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214547","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427276","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"70551","synopsis":"After finding out about Akane's late mother, Taiyou is ridden with guilt from calling her the \"Grim Reaper\" and has been keeping his distance ever since. As the end of summer vacation looms ever closer, can they ever make up again?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pdw5tHKID9rLldi4OdSZEguyQwj.jpg"},{"title":"Cambio di posto, rappresentanti di classe e nuove amicizie","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"157295","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53621","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214547","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427276","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"70649","synopsis":"With the start of September comes a new school semester, and Akane finds herself seated next to Taiyou. As the class decides on new class reps, Akane finds herself being volunteered for the job, much to the chagrin of an unexpected rival...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c2Doxf2DE34feXE7R8vjTS2YSKE.jpg"},{"title":"La gita e la magia delle uova sode","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"157295","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53621","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214547","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427276","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"70747","synopsis":"The class field trip to the space museum is approaching, but Akane is worried about Taiyou's sudden standoffish behavior. Will Akane be able to enjoy her first school trip with Taiyou? And what secrets lie within Akane's lunch box?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ahdMe9NuB0dAXRCtdc1uCq9axgP.jpg"},{"title":"Yukata, arrampicate e gesso","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"157295","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53621","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214547","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427276","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"70853","synopsis":"Akane accepts Yukiko's invite to her middle school cultural festival, unaware that a yukata date with Taiyou awaits! And as the school field day approaches, nothing can dampen Taiyou's excitement, or so you would think...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2aYkv7324caJiaq8GEqxuwNmfqG.jpg"},{"title":"Corri! Urla! La festa dello sport","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"157295","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53621","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214547","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427276","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"70955","synopsis":"With field day almost here, and Taiyou unable to take part in practice, Akane is determined to make the team relay race a success. But in order to make that happen, she'll have to ask for help from an unexpected ally...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7c6mS9CcvHUONUMQIAkXxoueAYy.jpg"},{"title":"I primi ospiti","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"ex